<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Italian Cyclical basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Italian Cyclical basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million American-style call warrants, on an Italian cyclical basket comprising Fiat SpA, Montedison SpA and Pirelli SpA, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    27,000.00 ITL	   PREMIUM	19.90 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4,150.00 ITL	    GEARING	6.30 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.OCT.98		 PAYDATE	21.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  25,980.00 ITL --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658  </p>
<p>NOTE - The basket comprises two Fiat shares, 10 Montedison shares and three Pirelli shares.</p>
</text>
